--
N5008 [temp.alias]/2: the alias cycle guard keyed the nested resolutions of
ull_constant<...> on irep comments, which irept::compare ignores, so the
third nested level was taken for a cycle and resolved to an empty type.
Reduced from libstdc++ 13 <chrono>'s __check_overflow (test_chrono.desc).
